# Copy this file to config/private-blocklist.txt and add one term per line.
# config/private-blocklist.txt is git-ignored. Never commit real terms.
#
# The lint also reads the same list from the PRIVATE_INFO_BLOCKLIST environment
# variable. Use that for Cursor cloud agents (a Cursor secret) and for the CI
# secret of the same name. Terms are case-insensitive literals of at least 3
# characters. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Example shape, not a real term:
# project-term-here
